<title>USA: Valspar buys packaging coatings business.</title>
<headline>Valspar buys packaging coatings business.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valspar Corp said Friday it completed the acquisition of the packaging coatings business of Gordon Bartels Co for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Sales of the business were about $6 million in 1995.</p>
<p>Valspar manufactures paints and coatings.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
